# Episode 4 opening "What Grows Back", 88 s (docs/design/episode3-4-opening.md 3.2 + 5.2; task E34-B).
# The other side of the same morning: Ysolde tells her life from Lark Hill (14 lines, voice-over through the hidden
# `narrator` cast, speaker ysolde = bf_emma; one line by Vessa, on screen). Voice: data/voice/manifest.json, same text
# as data/voice/lines/ep4_opening.json. B01 is Ep3's opening shot frame for frame ("the same morning").
# Sets: forge_evenmead (E34-A: landscape marks B01 S06 S12 B14R + the merged Lens marks S02 S07 S10 S11 S13),
# forge_ep4_memories (the flashbacks H03 H04 H05 H08 H09; four moods in one set: props/mood_zones.gd applies
# mood_winter / spring / frost / ash from the camera x). H03 -> H04 is a match cut: the same place and framing,
# winter then spring. Memories cut in on fade_white:0.4 and out on blend:0.3. Music / sfx: assets/audio/forge/.
# Axis: every Ep4 camera stays WEST of the Malrik - Ysolde line (Ep4 is the reverse angle of Ep3).
cine ep4_opening  title="Episode 4: What Grows Back"  letterbox=2.39  seed=34  length=85..91
use set forge_evenmead
use music res://assets/audio/forge/music/ep4_opening.wav  vol=-15
env day  moon_yaw=150  moon_pitch=-30  energy=1.0
# Evenmead close shots: S07 and S11 = forge_evenmead's merged Lens marks (tools/lens/specs/ep34_opening.lens; no cam=).
# S02 S10 S13 are re-aimed from their Lens marks as cam=dolly (a .cine `marks` override is not seen by the runtime
# player, which reads the set's markers: check RT1): Lens frames Ysolde from her Head pivot, so her antler crown was cut
# at the band top. S02 pulled back over her left shoulder (the valley, the ford and both hosts read; the mark was all
# back and crown), S10 the same 3/4-left side but ground-low through the bloom up to her face (Lens's "fs on bloom" alone
# in the tall grass did not read), S13 a low MCU (face and crown against the sky). cam=lens "<words>" solved at
# bake framed her chest / the wrong hill on this set. S12 (landscape mark) is now a long-lens over-the-shoulder: Ysolde
# on the right third, Malrik and Torvald at the top of the path across the valley.
# Ysolde narrates (voice-over: hidden, no name on the subtitles)
cast  narrator  capsule  at=(0, 0, -300)  hidden=1  speaker=ysolde

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the same morning
shot B01 8.0  in=fade_black:1.0
  at 0.0  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/evenmead_amb.wav  vol=-6
  at 3.0  line ysolde "Malrik tells his life as a list of wounds. Mine is a list of winters."  dur=4.6
# Ysolde on Lark Hill, the valley and Malrik's ridge beyond
# Lens mark "ms on ysolde, 3/4-back-left, high, push 0.2", re-aimed: over her shoulder to the ford and the hosts
shot S02 6.0  cam=dolly  from=(-9.75,7.9,37.0)  to=(-9.25,7.7,36.5)  look=(-4.0,6.02,30.0)>(-4.0,5.98,30.0)  fov=40>38  faces=ysolde
  at 0.3  line ysolde "I was born on that hill, the year nothing grew. Not one blade of grass."  dur=5.0
  at 0.3  anim ysolde set_expression  arg=worried

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- memory: the year nothing grew
# A heap of black earth on the snow, the seed's faint breath; the trowel left behind; the child watches it sleep
shot H03 6.0  set=forge_ep4_memories  in=fade_white:0.4
  at 0.3  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/snow_step.wav  vol=-10
  at 0.4  line ysolde "My mother buried seed in the snow. The village laughed. I watched it sleep."  dur=5.1
# Match cut: the same place in spring; the seed is a green seedling, her mother beside her
shot H04 5.0  set=forge_ep4_memories
  at 0.3  line ysolde "In spring it came up green. I have never forgotten how that felt."  dur=4.4
# The frost clearing: the child coaxes a rimed sapling; the tall man with the burning hem behind her
shot H05 6.0  set=forge_ep4_memories
  at 0.3  line ysolde "A tall man with a burning hem found me coaxing a sapling through the frost."  dur=5.1
  at 0.3  anim y_child set_expression  arg=smile

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- back on Lark Hill
# Nature and Fire ranks, travelling the other way on screen
shot S06 6.0  in=blend:0.3
  at 0.3  line ysolde "He said: show me again. So I did, for twenty years, until he was gone."  dur=5.0
  at 1.0  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/army_armour.wav  vol=-6
# Lens mark: "mcu on ysolde, 3/4-left, low"
shot S07 6.0  faces=ysolde
  at 0.3  line ysolde "They call me soft. Neutral. Slow. Slow is how an oak outlives an army."  dur=5.0
  at 0.0  anim ysolde set_expression  arg=neutral
  at 2.8  anim ysolde set_expression  arg=smile

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- memory: the burned wood
# Black trunks capped with frost, ice through the ash, her army frozen where it fell; she stands among them
shot H08 6.0  set=forge_ep4_memories  in=fade_white:0.4
  at 0.0  hide shoot
  at 0.3  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/ice_creak.wav  vol=-8
  at 0.3  line ysolde "Last winter they burned my wood and froze the ashes. My army with it."  dur=5.0
  at 0.3  anim y_ysolde set_expression  arg=worried
# Ground level: one green shoot in the black, against the low sun between the trunks (Ysolde stepped out of frame)
shot H09 6.0  set=forge_ep4_memories
  at 0.0  hide y_ysolde
  at 0.0  show shoot
  at 0.3  line ysolde "I knelt in the black, and I waited. Something green came up. It always does."  dur=5.2
  at 3.0  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/sapling_creak.wav  vol=-10

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- what grows back
# The flowers by her hand lean toward it: ground-low through the bloom, Ysolde (and Vessa) above against the sky
shot S10 6.0  cam=dolly  from=(-7.3,5.0,31.35)  to=(-7.14,5.02,31.55)  look=(-5.0,5.84,33.9)>(-5.0,5.86,33.9)  fov=44>41  in=blend:0.3  faces=ysolde
  at 0.3  line ysolde "That is my strength. Not fire. Not knives. I come back. Every spring. Every time."  dur=5.3
  at 0.0  anim ysolde set_expression  arg=neutral
  at 2.4  anim ysolde set_expression  arg=fierce
# Lens mark: "ms two-shot ysolde vessa, 3/4-left, eye"
shot S11 6.0  faces=ysolde,vessa
  at 0.3  line ysolde "The Master planted this country with his own hands. He left it to me to keep."  dur=5.1
  at 0.3  anim ysolde set_expression  arg=smile
  at 0.3  anim vessa set_expression  arg=smile
# Long lens north over her shoulder: Malrik's ridge, his amber staff, Torvald beside him
shot S12 9.0  cam=dolly  from=(-7.1,6.65,41.0)  to=(-7.0,6.65,40.4)  look=(-0.3,9.3,-36)  fov=22>20
  at 0.3  line ysolde "Malrik stands up there with his candle, his stone, and Torvald's winter."  dur=4.6
  at 5.1  line ysolde "Let them come. Cut it. Burn it. Freeze it."  dur=3.2
# Lens mark "cu on ysolde, front, eye, push 0.3", re-aimed: a low MCU, the crown against the sky, slow push
shot S13 5.0  cam=dolly  from=(-4.973,5.95,30.8)  to=(-4.973,6.0,31.45)  look=(-4.973,6.42,34.065)  fov=40  faces=ysolde
  at 0.3  line vessa "Ysolde. They're moving."  dur=1.8
  at 0.3  anim vessa set_expression  arg=worried
  at 0.0  anim ysolde set_expression  arg=neutral
  at 2.5  anim ysolde set_expression  arg=fierce
  at 2.6  line ysolde "It will not stop."  dur=2.0
# The same horns, from the south-west; the title
shot B14R 7.0
  at 0.5  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/evenmead_horns.wav  vol=0
  at 3.0  title "Episode 4" sub="What Grows Back" time=3.5
  at 6.2  fade alpha=1 time=0.8
